WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.660
Checklists: the documents each service needs, a library of ready checklists, and application settings.

2
00:00:09.206 --> 00:00:13.950
Add a ready list from the "Checklist library" or create a "New checklist".

3
00:00:14.504 --> 00:00:20.300
Add each document with "Add a document" and mark whether it's optional or sensitive.

4
00:00:20.846 --> 00:00:26.400
In the related words, write the service names so the right list is chosen automatically.

5
00:00:26.953 --> 00:00:31.700
A checklist used by applications isn't deleted but switched off.
